.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_RC4 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_rc4 ,
.Nm EVP_rc4_40 ,
.Nm EVP_rc4_hmac_md5
.Nd EVP RC4 stream cipher
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/evp.h
.Ft const EVP_CIPHER *
.Fo EVP_rc4
.Fa void
.Fc
.Ft const EVP_CIPHER *
.Fo EVP_rc4_40
.Fa void
.Fc
.Ft const EVP_CIPHER *
.Fo EVP_rc4_hmac_md5
.Fa void
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The RC4 stream cipher for EVP.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It EVP_rc4()
RC4 stream cipher.
This is a variable key length cipher with a default key length of 128
bits.
.It EVP_rc4_40()
RC4 stream cipher with 40 bit key length.
.Pp
WARNING: this function is obsolete.
Its usage should be replaced with the
.Fn EVP_rc4
and the
.Xr EVP_CIPHER_CTX_set_key_length 3
functions.
.It EVP_rc4_hmac_md5()
Authenticated encryption with the RC4 stream cipher with MD5 as HMAC.
.Pp
WARNING: this is not intended for usage outside of TLS and requires
calling of some undocumented ctrl functions.
These ciphers do not conform to the EVP AEAD interface.
.El
.Sh NOTES
Developers should be aware of the negative performance implications of
calling these functions multiple times and should consider using
.Xr EVP_CIPHER_fetch 3
with
.Xr EVP_CIPHER-RC4 7
instead.
See
.Xr crypto 7
for further information.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
These functions return an
.Sy EVP_CIPHER
structure that contains the implementation of the symmetric cipher.
See
.Xr EVP_CIPHER_meth_new 3
for details of the
.Sy EVP_CIPHER
structure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr evp 7 ,
.Xr EVP_EncryptInit 3 ,
.Xr EVP_CIPHER_meth_new 3
